---
description: >-
  Base-theme sequence diagram with `autonumber` enabled, covering the full
  combinatorial set of bidirectional central-connection arrows: solid and
  dotted, dual-central (`()` on both ends) in both LTR and RTL direction,
  plus single-sided central-connection bidirectional arrows at the start
  or end only.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Alice()<<->>()Bob: Dual central with bidirectional solid LTR
  Bob()<<->>()Alice: Dual central with bidirectional solid RTL
  Alice()<<-->>()Bob: Dual central with bidirectional dotted LTR
  Bob()<<-->>()Alice: Dual central with bidirectional dotted RTL
  Alice<<->>()Bob: Central at end with bidirectional LTR
  Bob()<<->>Alice: Central at start with bidirectional RTL
